//RS //! Typed paused-session inspection and evaluation boundary.
//RS //!
//RS //! This module is deliberately an adapter, not an evaluator.  A paused
//RS //! session supplies source-owned lexical facts and an injected evaluator
//RS //! supplies a checked result.  The adapter accepts neither a closure nor a
//RS //! command to run: it only checks identity, authority, cancellation, and
//RS //! budgets before projecting the supplied result.
//RS 
